WEBVTT

01:28.420 --> 01:32.260
Our Secret
EP01

01:56.120 --> 01:57.239
Please take a look at our press.

01:57.720 --> 01:58.360
Thank you.

02:16.920 --> 02:17.760
Hey, you there.

02:18.760 --> 02:19.880
This is the boy's dormitory.

02:19.880 --> 02:21.000
You can't get in.

02:21.720 --> 02:22.960
I know. I am a freshman.

02:23.120 --> 02:23.839
I just need to go inside to look for someone.

02:23.960 --> 02:25.160
That's not OK. You can't go against the rule.

02:25.280 --> 02:26.000
Just give me two minutes.

02:26.000 --> 02:26.640
What's the matter with you, kid?

02:26.640 --> 02:27.320
Just two minutes.

02:27.400 --> 02:27.920
No.

02:28.960 --> 02:30.440
If you keep doing this, I have to call the security office.

02:38.760 --> 02:40.120
Zhou Siyue.

02:41.240 --> 02:43.640
Zhou Siyue, I am coming for you now!

02:46.080 --> 02:47.480
Zhou Siyue, come out now!

02:47.560 --> 02:49.720
If you don't come out, I'll go in.

02:50.839 --> 02:52.240
Zhou Siyue.

02:53.160 --> 02:55.520
Zhou Siyue, I am coming to you now.

02:58.240 --> 02:59.440
Zhou Siyue.

03:01.840 --> 03:02.720
Ding Xian.

04:06.280 --> 04:07.200
Zhou Siyue.

04:08.320 --> 04:09.760
I'm so glad to see you.

04:21.839 --> 04:24.280
You don't answer my phone calls or messages.

04:24.960 --> 04:27.040
I thought you wouldn't come out to see me.

04:35.360 --> 04:37.040
I am here to tell you something.

04:41.000 --> 04:41.919
Say it.

04:45.040 --> 04:46.400
I like you.

04:48.960 --> 04:50.520
Did you ever like me?

05:00.760 --> 05:01.760
Ding Xian.

05:03.760 --> 05:05.680
I have no intention to have a relationship with anyone.

05:10.880 --> 05:12.520
It's late. You should go back.

05:14.000 --> 05:15.200
Focus on your classes.

05:15.760 --> 05:16.920
Don't come for me again.

05:28.200 --> 05:30.080
We promised to go to Huaqing University together.

05:31.600 --> 05:32.520
Now I've fulfilled my promise.

05:34.840 --> 05:35.760
I just want to know,

05:35.760 --> 05:37.720
have you ever liked me?

05:39.720 --> 05:41.120
Does it really matter,

05:42.880 --> 05:44.240
if I have or not?

05:52.160 --> 05:53.240
Ding Xian.

05:54.560 --> 05:56.520
We both have our own lives.

05:57.720 --> 05:59.040
So what?

06:22.800 --> 06:23.680
Zhou Siyue.

06:28.360 --> 06:29.800
Do you know my secret?

06:39.520 --> 06:41.080
It is late. I should leave now.

07:02.040 --> 07:03.120
Activate.

08:10.560 --> 08:12.560
August, 2009.

08:13.640 --> 08:16.320
The summer in the south was really hot.

08:17.920 --> 08:19.480
We said goodbye to Keshan Town

08:19.920 --> 08:21.640
and moved to Shenhai.

08:23.120 --> 08:26.000
Everything outside the window was new to me.

08:29.400 --> 08:31.600
It was a new beginning.

08:32.400 --> 08:34.000
I hoped Shenhai, this city,

08:34.000 --> 08:35.160
could be friendly to me.

08:36.120 --> 08:39.200
I wanted to maintain my good grades in the coming term.

08:39.319 --> 08:41.120
I wanted to make new friends.

08:42.280 --> 08:44.720
I hoped everything could go well.

08:47.960 --> 08:48.680
Please be careful.

08:48.680 --> 08:49.840
You need to be careful with this cabinet.

08:49.960 --> 08:51.120
Come, this way.

08:56.280 --> 08:57.040
Xian.

08:57.320 --> 08:58.680
Your books, here you are.

09:07.520 --> 09:08.400
Siyue.

09:08.600 --> 09:09.440
Siyue.

09:10.160 --> 09:11.280
The keys.

09:13.760 --> 09:14.920
Why are you always so lazy?

09:16.560 --> 09:17.160
What's wrong?

09:17.400 --> 09:18.040
I sprained my ankle.

09:19.440 --> 09:20.320
What are you doing here, standing?

09:20.600 --> 09:22.680
Hurry up and move your things. Don't dawdle.

09:25.400 --> 09:26.480
Ding Juncong.

09:39.880 --> 09:40.640
So spacious.

09:40.680 --> 09:42.040
Hurry up, guys.

09:42.040 --> 09:43.960
We need to have a meal outside later.

09:45.960 --> 09:47.720
Yes, the fridge, put it against the wall.

09:49.920 --> 09:51.320
The rest can be put in the secondary bedroom.

09:52.320 --> 09:53.680
Cong, Xian.

09:53.840 --> 09:54.800
You two share one room.

09:55.000 --> 09:56.160
- I refuse. - I refuse.

09:58.480 --> 09:59.280
I've grown up

09:59.440 --> 10:00.560
I don't want to live in the same room with him.

10:00.750 --> 10:02.320
Or, I can live in school.

10:02.360 --> 10:03.280
Live in school?

10:04.120 --> 10:06.400
With such a good apartment, you want to waste money on that?

10:06.640 --> 10:08.080
Do you think that we have too much money?

10:08.760 --> 10:09.560
Fine. Fine.

10:09.760 --> 10:10.800
There is still one small room left.

10:11.080 --> 10:12.200
It doesn't need to be used as my study.

10:12.360 --> 10:13.560
Make it a bedroom for them.

10:13.720 --> 10:14.640
Is that OK, Wanxian?

10:14.760 --> 10:15.640
OK. You two can choose by yourselves.

10:15.640 --> 10:16.760
OK.

10:19.560 --> 10:19.960
Slowly.

10:19.960 --> 10:20.520
Then I want this room.

10:20.520 --> 10:21.400
Me too.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.000
Ding Juncong!

10:25.200 --> 10:26.400
Why are you pushing me?

10:26.400 --> 10:27.640
Mum!

10:27.760 --> 10:28.760
What are you doing?

10:29.240 --> 10:30.240
You!

10:32.280 --> 10:33.080
Apologize.

10:33.280 --> 10:34.080
No way.

10:34.400 --> 10:35.280
Fine, if you don't apologize,

10:35.360 --> 10:36.200
this room is mine.

10:36.200 --> 10:36.960
No.

10:37.320 --> 10:37.960
You are just a kid.

10:37.960 --> 10:39.280
What do you want such a big room for?

10:39.760 --> 10:40.920
Whatever I want!

10:41.080 --> 10:42.160
I want this room!

10:42.440 --> 10:44.240
Xian, you are the elder sister.

10:44.280 --> 10:45.440
Just behave like one and let your brother have it, OK?

10:45.880 --> 10:46.120
Mum.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.320
Wanxian, where is my medical case?

10:47.400 --> 10:48.000
I don't know.

10:48.000 --> 10:48.960
Look for it by yourself.

10:49.240 --> 10:49.880
You...

10:50.720 --> 10:52.120
How did the medical case disappear?

10:58.000 --> 10:59.600
Xian, are you alright?

11:00.720 --> 11:01.560
I am fine.

11:01.560 --> 11:02.960
If you are fine, hurry up then.

11:03.120 --> 11:04.560
The Zhou family is waiting.

11:05.920 --> 11:07.400
I don't want to go.

11:07.680 --> 11:08.920
Don't dawdle. Hurry up.

11:12.920 --> 11:14.000
Coming!

11:20.800 --> 11:22.320
- Zhou. - Wencheng.

11:23.000 --> 11:24.040
I've looked forward to your visit.

11:24.480 --> 11:25.800
Please, come in.

11:25.840 --> 11:26.600
Say hello to Uncle Zhou.

11:26.800 --> 11:27.720
You don't have to change your shoes.

11:27.760 --> 11:28.440
- Hello, Uncle Zhou. - Hello, Uncle Zhou.

11:28.440 --> 11:29.160
You don't have to change them.

11:29.160 --> 11:29.800
Better change them.

11:29.800 --> 11:30.720
We don't want to stain your floor.

11:31.000 --> 11:31.720
What is this about?

11:32.080 --> 11:33.840
I have caused troubles for you about the school thing.

11:33.920 --> 11:35.320
Just take these as a token of my gratitude.

11:35.720 --> 11:37.120
Why are you being so formal with me now.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.320
I will put these here.

11:38.920 --> 11:40.200
Don't need to change your shoes. Just come in.

11:40.240 --> 11:40.840
Xiaoyun.

11:41.360 --> 11:42.080
Wencheng is here.

11:43.600 --> 11:44.320
Hello.

11:44.360 --> 11:45.400
So busy here, huh?

11:46.560 --> 11:47.160
Hello.

11:47.280 --> 11:47.880
Hello.

11:48.280 --> 11:50.880
Ding, Wanxian, welcome.

11:51.280 --> 11:52.040
This is

11:52.080 --> 11:53.680
Auntie Li, whom I always mentioned to you guys.

11:54.560 --> 11:55.000
Right?

11:55.000 --> 11:56.360
Sorry, Auntie Li.

11:56.520 --> 11:58.400
Actually my mum never mentioned you before.

11:58.680 --> 12:01.080
I've always wanted to pay you a visit with Xian.

12:02.320 --> 12:03.120
Right?

12:03.520 --> 12:04.800
The first sign of the rebellious phase of adolescence,

12:04.800 --> 12:05.880
lie without blinking.

12:07.080 --> 12:08.320
Auntie Li, nice to meet you.

12:08.960 --> 12:10.720
I have heard a lot about you from my mum.

12:11.400 --> 12:12.080
Such a good girl.

12:12.080 --> 12:12.840
Wencheng, have a seat.

12:12.840 --> 12:13.840
Right, come in.

12:13.840 --> 12:14.800
Please sit down and get ready for the meal.

12:14.840 --> 12:15.840
OK. Change your shoes.

12:17.640 --> 12:19.120
Your dad and Uncle Zhou have been friends since they were kids.

12:19.320 --> 12:21.440
It's all for your Uncle Zhou's help that your dad can work in Shenhai.

12:21.640 --> 12:23.480
Don't mess around, you two.

12:24.800 --> 12:25.920
Before you come,

12:26.080 --> 12:27.520
I told Xiaoyun that

12:27.760 --> 12:29.480
- it's been too long since last time we met Wencheng. - Please sit.

12:29.520 --> 12:31.160
We must have a good drink tonight.

12:31.200 --> 12:32.520
Right? A good drink.

12:32.560 --> 12:32.880
Hurry up.

12:32.880 --> 12:33.480
You don't object, right?

12:33.600 --> 12:34.400
Not at all.

12:34.440 --> 12:35.040
You should drink some too.

12:35.320 --> 12:36.520
OK, thanks.

12:37.720 --> 12:39.640
They are Siyue's classmates.

12:39.960 --> 12:41.240
They come to play games today.

12:41.680 --> 12:42.440
Uncle, Auntie.

12:42.480 --> 12:43.680
-Hello. -Where is Siyue?

12:45.000 --> 12:46.000
He falls asleep again.

12:46.120 --> 12:46.840
Get him out.

12:47.320 --> 12:49.360
Childe Zhou, stop sleeping.

12:49.520 --> 12:50.480
Your mum is asking you to come for meal!

12:50.480 --> 12:51.280
Coming.

12:51.480 --> 12:53.160
Study makes Children these days too tired.

12:53.640 --> 12:54.440
So many people here.

12:54.800 --> 12:55.520
Siyue,

12:55.800 --> 12:57.720
say hello to your Uncle Ding and Auntie Ye.

12:58.320 --> 12:59.560
Hello, Uncle Ding, Auntie Ye.

12:59.720 --> 13:00.920
You have grown so much.

13:01.240 --> 13:02.160
Sorry about him being late.

13:02.160 --> 13:03.400
What to be sorry about? Come on.

13:03.560 --> 13:04.920
It has been years since we last met.

13:05.520 --> 13:06.480
Let's toast and celebrate.

13:06.640 --> 13:08.080
Right, welcome, guys!

13:08.200 --> 13:09.360
Thank you. Sorry for the troubles.

13:09.600 --> 13:10.760
Thank you so much.

13:12.400 --> 13:13.120
Help yourselves.

13:14.560 --> 13:16.880
Xian, do you still remember?

13:17.280 --> 13:19.680
This is Siyue. You two met when you were still kids.

13:21.560 --> 13:22.720
Siyue,

13:22.960 --> 13:24.120
a really handsome boy.

13:24.520 --> 13:26.280
You have grown so much so quickly.

13:27.640 --> 13:30.000
I hugged you when you were still a kid.

13:31.120 --> 13:32.360
How time flies!

13:32.480 --> 13:33.960
That's right.

13:34.320 --> 13:35.880
They are in high school now.

13:36.680 --> 13:37.800
Right, Xian.

13:38.080 --> 13:40.920
I heard your rank was high in the senior high school entrance examination.

13:42.880 --> 13:44.400
695.

13:45.720 --> 13:46.560
That's great.

13:50.280 --> 13:51.960
It wasn't that good.

13:52.160 --> 13:53.320
Our Xian,

13:53.880 --> 13:56.440
she was studying until two o'clock midnight.

13:56.480 --> 13:57.560
And she won't listen to my persuasion.

13:57.560 --> 13:59.760
She loves studying so much.

14:02.120 --> 14:04.000
Siyue, how's your grade?

14:05.600 --> 14:06.480
Me?

14:07.760 --> 14:08.920
680.

14:10.040 --> 14:11.720
But that barely reaches the minimum passing score.

14:12.040 --> 14:13.320
Siyue is very talented.

14:13.760 --> 14:15.000
He passed the line even though he took the exam casually.

14:16.040 --> 14:17.840
Before the exam, we played video games together.

14:17.880 --> 14:19.280
You are also Siyue's classmate, right?

14:19.680 --> 14:20.640
What's your score?

14:25.040 --> 14:25.840
Auntie.

14:26.240 --> 14:27.080
No matter how the grade is,

14:27.400 --> 14:28.400
if you pass, then it is enough.

14:28.640 --> 14:30.160
The same as what I told Xian.

14:30.280 --> 14:31.600
Enough is good enough.

14:32.360 --> 14:33.720
But our Xian,

14:33.920 --> 14:35.680
she loves studying so much and doesn't want to lose to anyone.

14:36.680 --> 14:38.400
OK. Talk less and eat your meal.

14:38.680 --> 14:40.240
I can tell that Xian is a good girl.

14:40.640 --> 14:41.880
She will definitely achieve something in the future.

14:42.520 --> 14:43.880
That's because you taught her well, Ding.

14:44.040 --> 14:45.400
That's not my credit. You are joking.

14:45.400 --> 14:46.760
I need to learn from you.

14:46.960 --> 14:47.720
Learn from me?

14:47.800 --> 14:49.200
We learn from each other.

14:49.280 --> 14:51.360
Indeed. Regarding her study,

14:51.480 --> 14:53.000
Xian never worries me.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.200
Siyue,

14:55.480 --> 14:57.920
if you get any problems about study,

14:58.080 --> 14:59.320
you two can discuss them together.

14:59.520 --> 15:00.680
Xianxian knows them well.

15:02.160 --> 15:03.480
No problem, Auntie.

15:03.720 --> 15:04.280
I will.

15:04.280 --> 15:05.440
That's great.

15:05.960 --> 15:06.760
You guys

15:07.120 --> 15:08.960
should contact more from now on.

15:09.200 --> 15:10.480
After all, your grandfathers

15:10.680 --> 15:12.520
had a betrothal planned for you when you were still kids.

15:17.600 --> 15:18.640
Why did you mention that?

15:18.840 --> 15:20.040
But the topic goes there naturally.

15:20.160 --> 15:21.680
That is really the case.

15:22.160 --> 15:24.160
But it is too early for them

15:24.760 --> 15:26.480
to talk about this.

15:26.720 --> 15:27.960
After all, they are just high school students now.

15:27.960 --> 15:29.040
Right.

15:29.040 --> 15:30.040
They need to put study in the first place.

15:30.400 --> 15:31.240
Come on.

15:32.000 --> 15:33.280
What should I do to break off the betrothal?

15:35.720 --> 15:37.560
You are such a kid. Your Auntie Ye is just joking.

15:37.560 --> 15:38.440
And you take it seriously?

15:38.440 --> 15:39.080
That's right.

15:40.520 --> 15:42.440
I am joking along with Auntie Ye.

15:43.680 --> 15:44.160
Come on.

15:44.160 --> 15:45.240
What an interesting kid.

15:46.320 --> 15:47.800
Who wants you?

15:50.000 --> 15:51.880
Uncle Ding, Auntie Ye, please excuse me.

15:52.360 --> 15:53.320
I am full already.

15:53.800 --> 15:54.960
You eat so little?

15:55.200 --> 15:57.000
I ate too much this morning. Please continue.

15:57.160 --> 15:58.800
Me too. I am full now.

15:59.120 --> 16:00.120
Me too.

16:00.760 --> 16:01.760
Come on, ignore them.

16:01.840 --> 16:03.040
Sorry about them.

16:03.600 --> 16:05.640
The boys of this age are

16:05.920 --> 16:06.960
kinda rebellious.

16:07.080 --> 16:07.640
Right.

16:07.720 --> 16:08.600
Same here, too.

16:08.680 --> 16:10.240
Right, they are quite the same.

16:11.360 --> 16:12.640
Sis, I need to go to the bathroom.

16:13.000 --> 16:14.280
OK. I'll take you there.

16:19.320 --> 16:20.880
I scored 695.

16:22.360 --> 16:25.120
Our Xianxian is such a nice girl.

16:25.320 --> 16:26.840
She doesn't need me to worry.

16:27.240 --> 16:29.400
Our Xianxian knows everything.

16:29.680 --> 16:31.760
Her mother wants to claim kinship with Siyue.

16:32.360 --> 16:34.240
Who still makes child betrothal nowadays?

16:34.400 --> 16:35.840
Right. So funny.

16:36.640 --> 16:37.880
Did you see the bump on her head?

16:38.480 --> 16:39.800
Didn't it look like a horn?

16:40.200 --> 16:41.840
She tried to hide it from us, but we still can see it.

16:42.320 --> 16:44.320
Like the monster Shrek.

16:44.760 --> 16:46.200
That green one, right?

16:46.920 --> 16:48.400
Who's his wife anyway?

16:48.760 --> 16:49.760
Fiona.

16:49.920 --> 16:50.800
Fiona.

16:51.280 --> 16:52.600
Princess Fiona.

16:53.280 --> 16:54.240
Princess Fiona.

16:55.200 --> 16:56.400
Princess Fiona.

16:56.880 --> 16:57.760
How do you feel?

16:57.760 --> 16:59.400
Now that you have a fiancée,

16:59.560 --> 17:00.440
how do you feel?

17:01.400 --> 17:03.080
Can you cut the crap?

17:03.080 --> 17:04.600
You dare to kick me again?

17:05.240 --> 17:06.440
Sis, the toilet paper runs out.

17:13.720 --> 17:16.000
No way. Do you think that she heard everything?

17:26.119 --> 17:26.720
What should we do?

17:27.839 --> 17:28.640
Open the door.

17:32.720 --> 17:35.240
Fix the mistake you made. Hurry.

17:42.960 --> 17:43.800
Monster...

17:44.480 --> 17:46.720
Beauty, what can I help you with?

17:47.800 --> 17:49.160
There is no toilet paper in the bathroom.

17:49.320 --> 17:50.400
Do you have any?

17:50.960 --> 17:51.520
Yes.

17:54.320 --> 17:56.160
Toilet paper. Toilet paper.

18:00.520 --> 18:01.880
You can't drink anymore.

18:01.960 --> 18:03.360
No, can't drink anymore, Zhou.

18:12.320 --> 18:14.120
Didn't you just hear everything?

18:14.760 --> 18:15.960
You're good at drinking now.

18:16.520 --> 18:17.600
If I break off the betrothal,

18:18.400 --> 18:19.880
will you be happy?

18:22.080 --> 18:23.040
Yes.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.520
Then I won't.

18:28.880 --> 18:30.440
The second sign of the rebellious phase of adolescence,

18:31.040 --> 18:32.280
I won't let you satisfy.

18:33.480 --> 18:34.400
Here is your paper.

18:36.960 --> 18:37.920
This kid.

18:39.960 --> 18:40.920
Look at you.

18:41.480 --> 18:42.920
You really don't know how to grasp a chance when it comes.

18:43.800 --> 18:45.360
What a good chance today,

18:45.760 --> 18:47.200
and why don't you

18:47.400 --> 18:48.640
talk with Siyue more.

18:49.240 --> 18:50.400
I don't know what to talk to him.

18:50.400 --> 18:51.440
There is nothing for us to talk about.

18:52.280 --> 18:53.360
You are just like your dad.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.680
You guys don't know how to socialize.

18:55.880 --> 18:57.040
When you enter the society in the future,

18:57.040 --> 18:58.160
you will definitely be at a disadvantage.

18:58.520 --> 18:59.800
But take a look at Zhou Siyue,

19:00.360 --> 19:01.920
he must be very popular.

19:04.040 --> 19:06.080
Didn't my social life all ruined by you?

19:06.080 --> 19:07.400
How dare you talk to your mother like that?

19:08.120 --> 19:09.280
What are you looking for?

19:09.500 --> 19:10.120
Where is my hat?

19:10.280 --> 19:11.480
It is not here. Stop that.

19:11.720 --> 19:13.400
You make such a mess. I can't tidy it up.

19:13.520 --> 19:14.280
Go.

19:14.280 --> 19:16.120
Then do you know where the drugstore is?

19:16.160 --> 19:17.240
How should I know?

19:18.160 --> 19:19.840
When I tidy everything up, I will look for your medicine.

19:20.920 --> 19:21.760
Xianxian.

19:22.120 --> 19:23.720
Maybe I can go with you?

19:23.960 --> 19:25.520
No, dad. I can go myself.

19:26.920 --> 19:28.200
I am going to the drugstore now.

19:28.400 --> 19:29.240
Yes.

19:30.400 --> 19:31.520
Trash.

19:31.720 --> 19:32.640
Boring.

19:33.440 --> 19:34.560
What are you going to do this afternoon?

19:35.280 --> 19:36.080
Play basketball.

19:37.720 --> 19:39.680
Dude, don't you see how my foot injured?

19:39.840 --> 19:41.120
Can you show some mercy?

19:42.080 --> 19:42.920
Ouch!

19:43.120 --> 19:44.360
So now you know it hurts.

19:44.640 --> 19:45.640
When you spoke ill about the girl just now,

19:45.760 --> 19:46.880
didn't you feel happy?

19:46.920 --> 19:48.920
I am not joking. It really hurts.

19:49.800 --> 19:50.600
And

19:51.120 --> 19:52.080
it starts to feel

19:52.240 --> 19:53.200
more and more painful.

19:54.360 --> 19:55.240
Perhaps

19:55.560 --> 19:57.080
you guys can take me to the doctor's.

20:00.240 --> 20:01.760
I happen to know a place.

20:02.760 --> 20:03.960
Where is it?

20:07.920 --> 20:10.440
Can you not grab me when you are hurting?

20:10.680 --> 20:13.040
Young boy, you can't even take this pain?

20:18.000 --> 20:19.920
Doctor, can you be more gentle?

20:20.200 --> 20:21.240
It'll be finished right away.

20:21.240 --> 20:22.560
I can't take it.

20:35.800 --> 20:36.720
Miss,

20:37.000 --> 20:38.120
are you from Shen Hai High School?

20:38.360 --> 20:39.360
The new term is about to start.

20:41.240 --> 20:42.640
I know what you are looking for.

20:44.560 --> 20:45.440
This.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.040
To help you boost your memory.

20:48.520 --> 20:49.360
These.

20:50.640 --> 20:51.480
Take them back.

20:51.680 --> 20:52.560
Let your parents boil them up.

20:52.640 --> 20:54.520
I am not here for these.

20:55.120 --> 20:57.000
Then what do you want to buy?

20:57.720 --> 20:59.280
I, here.

21:01.640 --> 21:04.000
What did you bump into?

21:05.720 --> 21:07.040
Some kind of ghost.

21:07.720 --> 21:10.240
I don't care what you bumped into. I recommend

21:11.720 --> 21:12.720
this to you.

21:12.720 --> 21:14.760
I promise that if you apply it on today,

21:14.920 --> 21:16.920
you are as good as new tomorrow.

21:17.080 --> 21:18.120
Like you've never bumped into anything.

21:18.120 --> 21:20.720
Come on, have a try.

21:21.240 --> 21:22.240
You can do it!

21:22.240 --> 21:22.960
I will pay the bill first.

21:22.960 --> 21:23.640
Hang in there.

21:23.720 --> 21:24.800
Siyue, I'll go with you.

21:28.560 --> 21:29.840
Boss, the bill.

21:30.720 --> 21:31.360
Wait a second.

21:32.680 --> 21:33.600
What a coincidence.

21:34.000 --> 21:35.320
Not my intention.

21:37.400 --> 21:39.240
Why is your bump getting even bigger?

21:41.120 --> 21:42.680
I don't want to mess around with you.

21:42.920 --> 21:44.160
Boss, I won't buy it.

21:44.840 --> 21:47.720
Miss, you haven't paid.

21:49.880 --> 21:51.320
I didn't use it.

21:52.520 --> 21:55.240
It is opened. How can I sell it to others?

21:57.200 --> 21:58.600
How much is it?

21:59.320 --> 22:02.160
It should be 100. But since you are student,

22:02.920 --> 22:04.240
I will give you a 20% off.

22:04.520 --> 22:06.360
80, then.

22:06.680 --> 22:07.920
80?

22:08.160 --> 22:10.800
It is only around ten Yuan in my hometown.

22:11.000 --> 22:12.960
This is a patent of our shop.

22:13.160 --> 22:14.920
Its cost is high.

22:20.560 --> 22:23.840
Can I buy half of it?

22:24.080 --> 22:25.160
Half?

22:25.680 --> 22:29.080
Are you kidding with me, Miss?

22:31.040 --> 22:32.800
Boss, I'll take it.

22:33.800 --> 22:35.280
This is for the foot massage?

22:37.040 --> 22:38.000
Is that enough?

22:38.360 --> 22:39.320
This is?

22:39.840 --> 22:40.560
For the drug.

22:40.880 --> 22:41.720
Thank you.

22:41.920 --> 22:42.960
I'll wrap it up for you.

22:43.720 --> 22:44.760
Thank you.

22:45.320 --> 22:48.200
When I get my pocket money next week, I'll give you back.

22:49.480 --> 22:50.160
How about

22:50.600 --> 22:51.720
treating me a meal now?

22:51.960 --> 22:53.040
Then we are even.

22:53.800 --> 22:54.480
OK.

22:55.400 --> 22:56.560
What do you want to eat?

22:58.120 --> 23:00.200
A big meal, of course.

23:01.680 --> 23:02.280
Let's go.

23:03.560 --> 23:04.160
Miss,

23:05.680 --> 23:06.520
your medicine

23:06.960 --> 23:07.760
Thanks.

23:08.200 --> 23:08.960
You are welcome.

23:08.960 --> 23:10.000
Take care.

23:17.040 --> 23:17.760
Boss.

23:18.240 --> 23:19.080
Here you are.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.160
Give me some fish balls.

23:21.280 --> 23:21.840
OK.

23:23.240 --> 23:24.120
Boss.

23:24.520 --> 23:25.640
One more marinated egg.

23:25.880 --> 23:26.600
Please wait a moment.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.120
Have a seat.

23:31.120 --> 23:33.360
This is the big meal you want to eat?

23:34.640 --> 23:36.400
This shop has been here for over a dozen years.

23:36.600 --> 23:37.560
Its food is delicious.

23:42.040 --> 23:42.920
About that thing today,

23:43.640 --> 23:45.040
you don't need to think too much.

23:45.520 --> 23:47.080
They are just like that.

23:47.240 --> 23:49.600
Big mouth, but they don't mean harm.

23:53.200 --> 23:54.040
Here you are.

23:54.240 --> 23:54.960
Thank you.

23:56.320 --> 23:57.240
Have a taste.

23:59.640 --> 24:00.440
Have a taste.

24:00.760 --> 24:01.760
It is not poisonous.

24:09.440 --> 24:10.960
It is actually tasty.

24:11.200 --> 24:12.400
Why don't you eat?

24:12.640 --> 24:14.120
I am not hungry. It's for you.

24:19.360 --> 24:21.280
There are many delicious foods in Shenhai.

24:21.840 --> 24:24.200
You can have a try if you get the chance.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.160
Boss.

24:29.920 --> 24:31.040
One more marinated egg.

24:31.040 --> 24:31.880
Sure.

24:31.880 --> 24:33.920
I don't need another one. One is enough.

24:35.440 --> 24:37.360
This is for your bump.

24:37.920 --> 24:39.160
Not for you to eat.

24:39.560 --> 24:40.800
Look at your bump on your forehead.

24:41.200 --> 24:42.840
It is becoming a horn now.

24:47.000 --> 24:48.680
A horn? What horn?

24:54.680 --> 24:55.680
Here you are, the egg.

24:58.160 --> 24:58.960
I'll pay now.

24:58.960 --> 24:59.640
OK.

25:09.920 --> 25:10.680
I'm home.

25:15.920 --> 25:17.280
Why did you get another one of this?

25:17.800 --> 25:19.360
I just bought one two days ago.

25:20.040 --> 25:21.480
The shop assistant recommended me to buy it.

25:21.960 --> 25:23.280
The quality looks good.

25:23.600 --> 25:25.880
And they even gave me an apron for free.

25:29.560 --> 25:30.240
Right.

25:30.600 --> 25:32.320
The new term is about to start the day after tomorrow.

25:32.480 --> 25:33.760
Have you prepared everything?

25:34.520 --> 25:35.800
Actually, I am going to school tomorrow.

25:37.480 --> 25:38.240
Tomorrow?

25:39.560 --> 25:42.000
I got confused by so many things.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.240
It doesn't matter. It is all the same.

25:46.480 --> 25:48.320
The new term is about to start. Be careful not to catch a cold.

25:48.480 --> 25:50.240
There is a big day-night temperature difference in this season.

25:50.400 --> 25:51.480
I will fetch you a coat.

25:51.600 --> 25:52.720
Don't bother.

25:53.160 --> 25:54.240
I am fine.

25:54.480 --> 25:57.680
Maybe it was just someone spoke ill of me.

25:58.600 --> 25:59.360
Marinated egg.

25:59.800 --> 26:00.720
Stupid marinated egg.

26:18.440 --> 26:19.280
Tomorrow,

26:19.600 --> 26:20.560
I'll finally become

26:20.560 --> 26:21.760
a member of the Shen Hai High School.

26:24.760 --> 26:26.000
But I hope

26:26.400 --> 26:27.480
tomorrow, as the term begins,

26:27.480 --> 26:28.480
I won't encounter

26:28.480 --> 26:29.600
that guy.

26:47.560 --> 26:48.720
It's really gone.

26:49.000 --> 26:49.800
Ding Xian.

26:50.160 --> 26:50.840
Hurry up.

26:51.000 --> 26:52.640
Or you won't catch up with your father.

26:52.920 --> 26:53.760
Dad, you go first.

26:54.240 --> 26:55.320
I'll go to school by myself.

26:56.200 --> 26:57.080
I am late.

26:57.240 --> 26:58.120
Fine, you go by yourself.

26:58.120 --> 26:58.960
Hurry up.

26:59.880 --> 27:00.760
Ding Wencheng.

27:01.000 --> 27:02.800
Be more sensible on your first day at work.

27:02.960 --> 27:04.600
OK. I'm leaving.

27:04.880 --> 27:05.920
Take care.

27:10.880 --> 27:12.200
Mum, did you see my school badge?

27:12.200 --> 27:13.480
No, where did you put it?

27:13.800 --> 27:14.520
I...

27:15.040 --> 27:16.600
Why are you laughing? Did you take it?

27:17.280 --> 27:18.960
No, I didn't touch anything.

27:19.920 --> 27:20.880
It must be you.

27:21.360 --> 27:22.400
Ding Juncong, did you take it?

27:22.560 --> 27:23.960
Give it back to your sister now. See how anxious she is.

27:24.120 --> 27:24.960
I didn't take it.

27:25.760 --> 27:27.360
Ding Xian, did you get it?

27:27.400 --> 27:28.120
No.

27:28.360 --> 27:29.280
Where did you put it?

27:29.280 --> 27:30.080
You put things around casually.

27:30.080 --> 27:31.080
I just put it on the desk.

27:33.560 --> 27:34.400
You're going to be late.

27:34.640 --> 27:36.240
Hurry up, Ding Xian. Just go.

27:37.400 --> 27:38.560
Then I'll go first.

27:42.720 --> 27:44.640
How can a girl just sit on the floor?

27:45.080 --> 27:46.200
Mum, goodbye.

27:46.560 --> 27:48.320
Take it slow. Be careful.

28:04.160 --> 28:04.800
Hey.

28:05.440 --> 28:06.360
Jiang Chen.

28:06.760 --> 28:09.000
I've lent you my bike for the whole summer vacation.

28:09.400 --> 28:10.840
Give it back to me this noon.

28:11.840 --> 28:13.200
I am late for school now.

28:27.360 --> 28:28.880
Isn't the school this way?

28:34.280 --> 28:35.440
Don't close the gate!

28:42.960 --> 28:45.000
Dear teachers and students,

28:45.480 --> 28:47.080
as the zephyr greets us

28:47.520 --> 28:49.480
and flowers bloom, in this good season,

28:50.160 --> 28:52.720
we've welcomed a bunch of new students to our school.

28:53.280 --> 28:54.880
Here, let's express

28:55.320 --> 28:56.600
our welcome to them.

28:58.240 --> 29:00.440
In the National College Entrance Examination that just came to an end,

29:01.240 --> 29:03.080
the senior high school department of Shen Hai High School,

29:03.560 --> 29:04.800
has again acquired...

29:04.800 --> 29:05.680
You,

29:05.680 --> 29:07.880
why are you late on the first day of the new term?

29:08.440 --> 29:09.520
I got lost.

29:09.840 --> 29:11.000
Lost?

29:11.520 --> 29:13.360
Why didn't you lose yourself then?

29:14.400 --> 29:15.320
Go stand at the back!

29:16.960 --> 29:18.120
Go!

29:20.240 --> 29:21.080
Here,

29:21.200 --> 29:23.560
I want to express my sincere congratulation to everyone.

29:24.840 --> 29:25.760
I know that

29:25.920 --> 29:29.400
many students are from the main campus of this school.

29:29.880 --> 29:30.840
And I believe

29:30.840 --> 29:33.360
that you are all familiar with the place.

29:33.840 --> 29:34.760
But,

29:35.240 --> 29:38.200
high school is a brand-new start for all of you.

29:38.400 --> 29:39.840
You are quite early.

29:44.800 --> 29:46.000
Such bad luck.

29:46.440 --> 29:47.680
Together with the teachers,

29:48.000 --> 29:49.720
I wish you could build

29:49.720 --> 29:51.200
a good study environment.

29:55.000 --> 29:56.120
I have known you for so many years.

29:56.120 --> 29:57.440
What's the matter with my borrowing your mirror?

29:57.520 --> 29:58.160
No way.

30:00.000 --> 30:00.760
Stingy.

30:01.920 --> 30:03.160
You are the one who is stingy.

30:03.520 --> 30:05.000
Then lend me your mirror.

30:05.400 --> 30:06.480
I don't want to.

30:07.120 --> 30:07.760
Fine.

30:09.000 --> 30:11.120
After knowing each other for so many years,

30:11.960 --> 30:14.320
our friendship finally comes to an end.

30:14.680 --> 30:15.320
Kong Shadi.

30:15.360 --> 30:16.360
What, Song Ziqi?

30:16.400 --> 30:18.680
How come I can never get out of your control?

30:20.240 --> 30:21.920
Who wants to be your deskmate?

30:28.560 --> 30:31.000
Good for you. You are late for school on the first day.

30:31.360 --> 30:32.200
What to be scared of?

30:32.520 --> 30:34.360
I am not the only one who is late anyway.

30:37.880 --> 30:38.680
Why are you looking at me?

30:39.440 --> 30:41.160
Is there another seat for me to sit?

30:43.040 --> 30:44.360
Where is your school badge?

30:46.320 --> 30:48.480
You guys are so done.

30:48.720 --> 30:50.200
You guys will surely become

30:50.400 --> 30:51.560
the VIPs of Auntie Liu.

30:52.000 --> 30:53.080
Auntie Liu?

30:53.640 --> 30:54.160
Who?

30:54.200 --> 30:54.960
You don't know?

30:55.720 --> 30:57.080
The teacher on the opening ceremony.

30:57.120 --> 30:58.360
Talking non-stop.

30:58.840 --> 31:00.600
Just like my auntie.

31:00.880 --> 31:02.120
He meddles in everything.

31:02.480 --> 31:04.440
From your grade to your hair length.

31:04.480 --> 31:06.160
Anything he can meddle in.

31:07.160 --> 31:10.120
I believe you two have experienced it just now.

31:34.560 --> 31:36.000
Good morning, students.

31:36.400 --> 31:38.160
I am your new politics teacher.

31:38.600 --> 31:40.880
My name is Ding Wencheng.

31:43.480 --> 31:44.320
Mr. Ding.

31:44.840 --> 31:46.360
Can we start the lesson with the exercises we did?

31:50.120 --> 31:51.280
That's OK, too.

31:52.600 --> 31:55.440
Then, everyone. Take out the paper of last year.

32:01.840 --> 32:03.000
Let's take a look at the first question.

32:05.120 --> 32:06.040
Stand up.

32:07.920 --> 32:10.800
Good morning, teacher.

32:11.800 --> 32:12.680
Sit down please.

32:15.040 --> 32:17.600
Deng Wanwan, before we elect the class leaders officially,

32:17.920 --> 32:19.520
you will be the acting class monitor.

32:19.520 --> 32:20.200
Sure.

32:20.320 --> 32:22.080
I want to add a few points.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.040
You see how she is showing off?

32:23.040 --> 32:24.520
-The National College Entrance Examination -After Yang Chunzi took a leave,

32:24.600 --> 32:25.720
she has become so hyped up.

32:25.720 --> 32:27.560
is like thousands of troops and horses crossing a single-log bridge.

32:27.760 --> 32:28.880
From this moment on,

32:29.920 --> 32:31.560
it's officially started.

32:31.920 --> 32:34.440
There is no turning back.

32:34.800 --> 32:37.600
Now that you have entered this gate,

32:37.960 --> 32:39.680
you guys are members of Shen Hai High School already.

32:40.080 --> 32:41.400
At least, you should live up to

32:41.560 --> 32:43.200
the name of Shen Hai High School.

32:44.000 --> 32:46.920
You need to prepare mentally for your study.

32:47.200 --> 32:49.160
There is no need

32:49.160 --> 32:50.680
to take notes about those meaningless pep talk, right?

32:51.440 --> 32:53.200
You will learn a lot of difficult subjects.

32:53.960 --> 32:56.280
Did anyone tell you not to peek around?

32:57.200 --> 32:58.040
And

32:59.240 --> 33:00.640
I have a name.

33:01.760 --> 33:02.720
OK.

33:03.920 --> 33:05.120
Got it.

33:07.480 --> 33:08.520
And let me tell you,

33:09.120 --> 33:10.720
don't try to talk to me so much from now on.

33:14.600 --> 33:16.200
I try to talk to you?

33:17.720 --> 33:19.360
You keep talking to me, don't you?

33:19.800 --> 33:21.080
Don't try to cotton up.

33:21.920 --> 33:23.320
We are about to change seats soon.

33:24.000 --> 33:26.520
Which means, we're just temporary deskmates.

33:29.360 --> 33:30.280
Fine.

33:31.160 --> 33:32.920
Temporary deskmates.

33:33.560 --> 33:35.080
About the arrangement of your seats,

33:35.200 --> 33:36.600
it is not in a hurry yet.

33:37.280 --> 33:40.120
The placement test is one month later.

33:40.400 --> 33:42.280
I'll give you one month

33:42.680 --> 33:44.520
to review

33:44.800 --> 33:46.320
all the knowledge you've learned.

33:46.640 --> 33:48.720
After a month, based your grade,

33:48.920 --> 33:50.680
I will then rearrange your seats.

33:51.600 --> 33:52.200
And,

33:52.440 --> 33:53.960
from now on,

33:54.200 --> 33:57.560
if I find anyone not wearing his or her school badge,

33:58.200 --> 33:59.760
he or she can go home directly.

34:02.400 --> 34:03.680
I will not call names.

34:03.880 --> 34:06.080
But they know exactly whom I am talking about.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.320
Uncle Ding.

34:18.600 --> 34:19.720
Bocong.

34:20.760 --> 34:22.560
I never thought you would teach our class.

34:23.240 --> 34:24.800
Where do you sit?

34:25.080 --> 34:26.120
There.

34:26.600 --> 34:28.880
My poor eyesight. I didn't even see you just now.

34:29.399 --> 34:30.919
The books are piled up.

34:31.080 --> 34:32.280
It is natural that you couldn't to see me.

34:32.919 --> 34:34.880
Look how much you have grown.

34:35.160 --> 34:36.320
It feels like yesterday

34:36.479 --> 34:38.600
that you and Xianxian running around together.

34:39.120 --> 34:40.120
Right, Uncle Ding.

34:40.320 --> 34:41.640
Xianxian got in our school through the exam, right?

34:42.360 --> 34:44.080
She is in Senior One Class Three.

34:44.280 --> 34:46.320
Xianxian has always looked up to you.

34:46.479 --> 34:48.560
That's why she studied so hard to get into Shenhai.

34:48.720 --> 34:51.720
Is that so? Senior One Class Three is a key class, right?

34:52.200 --> 34:54.080
She is much better than I first entered the school.

34:54.320 --> 34:56.600
Uncle Ding, now that you become a teacher of our school, I feel reassured.

34:56.919 --> 34:58.120
In this case, you can

34:58.280 --> 34:59.640
take care of Xian.

34:59.880 --> 35:01.360
Right, like at noon,

35:01.640 --> 35:04.120
I can have lunch with her.

35:05.040 --> 35:06.320
I need to hurry now.

35:06.400 --> 35:08.000
They want me to join a meeting.

35:08.000 --> 35:08.800
OK, see you around.

35:09.920 --> 35:10.440
Uncle Ding.

35:11.120 --> 35:11.640
Uncle Ding.

35:12.440 --> 35:13.320
Thank you.

35:13.440 --> 35:14.080
Just take it slow.

35:24.160 --> 35:25.520
Siyue, let's have lunch.

35:26.000 --> 35:27.840
Let's go, Miss Temporary Deskmate.

35:53.880 --> 35:55.040
Are you guys going or not?

35:55.200 --> 35:56.120
I am starving.

35:56.280 --> 35:57.000
Go.

35:57.240 --> 35:58.080
Wait a second.

35:59.520 --> 36:01.520
I have something to talk to you.

36:01.720 --> 36:03.080
The Teachers' Day is coming, right?

36:03.280 --> 36:05.280
I want to talk about the gifts for teachers.

36:05.760 --> 36:06.760
Right, Siyue.

36:06.920 --> 36:08.080
Mr. Liu asked for you.

36:08.240 --> 36:10.280
Something about joining the Olympic competition group.

36:12.680 --> 36:13.880
Then, wait for me, guys.

36:13.880 --> 36:14.640
Sure.

36:20.200 --> 36:21.600
Why is Zhou Siyue not here yet?

36:21.600 --> 36:23.760
If he doesn't come now, there will be nothing left in the canteen.

36:23.840 --> 36:24.840
Where is he now?

36:25.000 --> 36:25.800
I don't know.

36:27.840 --> 36:29.560
Ding Xian, let's go for lunch.

36:29.640 --> 36:31.480
I heard that the canteen of the senior department is quite fancy.

36:31.640 --> 36:32.720
It is not like that in main campus of our school.

36:32.720 --> 36:34.080
That's it. We should stop waiting for him.

36:34.280 --> 36:36.200
Go. Let's go to have lunch.

36:37.200 --> 36:39.080
My dad still wants to eat with me at school.

36:39.200 --> 36:40.480
That's embarrassing.

36:40.560 --> 36:41.560
You guys go.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.520
Why is she running away again?

36:51.240 --> 36:52.040
You two are to blame.

36:52.240 --> 36:53.520
You kept picking at her in the morning.

36:53.720 --> 36:55.160
That's why she doesn't want to eat with us.

36:55.320 --> 36:56.360
Why has it anything to do with me?

36:56.560 --> 36:57.880
You should ask Childe Zhou here,

36:58.040 --> 36:59.120
what he did do to upset her.

36:59.600 --> 37:00.840
It's none of my business.

37:01.800 --> 37:02.960
Then explain to me.

37:03.160 --> 37:04.520
Why did she run as soon as she saw you?

37:05.400 --> 37:06.880
It's her legs.

37:07.120 --> 37:08.480
You should ask her.

37:09.040 --> 37:10.360
You can't put it that way.

37:11.320 --> 37:12.480
Didn't you guys have, like,

37:13.560 --> 37:14.440
a child betrothal?

37:17.160 --> 37:17.760
What?

37:18.120 --> 37:18.840
Don't you know?

37:19.480 --> 37:20.120
Come, let me tell you.

37:20.440 --> 37:21.680
That was a dark night.

37:21.680 --> 37:22.960
You couldn't even see your own fingers.

37:23.080 --> 37:23.720
Our Childe Zhou here...

37:23.720 --> 37:25.000
Are you going to keep talking and talking?

37:26.200 --> 37:27.080
No, sorry.

37:27.240 --> 37:28.360
I am just kidding. I'll shut my mouth.

37:30.520 --> 37:31.400
Hold on.

37:36.240 --> 37:37.000
Xianxian.

37:38.360 --> 37:39.400
Hello, Bocong.

37:40.120 --> 37:42.440
You don't try to find me when you are now in Shen Hai High School?

37:43.800 --> 37:45.600
I was afraid that you might be too busy.

37:45.920 --> 37:46.800
Senior three.

37:47.120 --> 37:48.520
It terrifies me when I think of it.

37:49.360 --> 37:50.360
It's not that terrible.

37:50.640 --> 37:52.480
How about you? What do you feel in the school?

37:56.080 --> 37:57.120
I didn't lie to you, right?

37:57.320 --> 37:57.960
Shen Hai High School is a stressful place.

37:57.960 --> 37:59.440
I am not kidding about it.

37:59.520 --> 38:01.240
Students from the main campus and those from other schools

38:01.600 --> 38:02.360
are really different.

38:08.800 --> 38:11.040
I don't think they are so different.

38:12.080 --> 38:14.200
You don't need to think too much.

38:14.440 --> 38:15.480
Just make more friends.

38:15.640 --> 38:17.800
Makes your high school life more meaningful here.

38:20.240 --> 38:21.360
I will try my best.

38:22.320 --> 38:24.000
Have a taste.

38:24.240 --> 38:26.600
Famous dish of Shen Hai High School, stewed pork with brown sauce.

38:26.600 --> 38:27.440
Special perk for Senior Three students.

38:29.920 --> 38:30.840
Look.

38:31.720 --> 38:33.440
Little Monster knows that guy?

38:33.440 --> 38:34.040
Delicious.

38:35.260 --> 38:36.520
Who's that?

38:36.640 --> 38:37.840
I heard about him.

38:38.120 --> 38:39.520
Su Bocong.

38:39.800 --> 38:41.120
Arts class of Senior Three.

38:41.400 --> 38:43.320
He is quite a gentleman.

38:43.600 --> 38:45.040
His grade is very good too.

38:45.440 --> 38:46.680
He is unlike you guys.

38:47.000 --> 38:48.560
You say this because he is handsome?

38:50.560 --> 38:52.360
I heard that he was also from Keshan.

38:53.800 --> 38:55.400
That's why he knows Little Monster.

38:55.800 --> 38:57.240
Eat your meal, would you?

38:57.400 --> 38:58.240
Hear me out.

38:59.120 --> 39:01.040
I heard that this guy is really awesome.

39:01.520 --> 39:02.760
His grades are excellent.

39:02.800 --> 39:04.000
More importantly, he studies very hard.

39:04.600 --> 39:07.520
For three years, he has never been out of Top 10.

39:08.000 --> 39:08.880
Badass.

39:17.200 --> 39:18.360
How good-looking that is!

39:19.600 --> 39:21.840
Siyue, have you decided what to buy?

39:22.720 --> 39:24.520
What? Gift for Teachers' Day.

39:24.720 --> 39:25.960
I told you this morning.

39:26.680 --> 39:27.680
Count me in.

39:28.200 --> 39:29.720
Quit your nonsense.

39:30.120 --> 39:32.560
Is she talking to you?

39:34.760 --> 39:35.640
Maybe later.

39:38.080 --> 39:40.200
Ding Xian, your textbooks are so new.

39:40.880 --> 39:42.960
You don't need to go to tutor classes during vacation?

39:43.960 --> 39:44.720
No.

39:44.920 --> 39:46.120
You are so relaxed.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.760
So many students in our class have already

39:47.800 --> 39:49.360
finished learning the textbook of this term.

39:51.040 --> 39:52.240
So what?

39:52.440 --> 39:53.520
I forgot it all anyway.

39:54.120 --> 39:55.880
I had no fun during the vacation.

39:56.320 --> 39:57.480
I thought that

39:57.560 --> 39:58.880
I could be more relaxed since I came from the main campus.

39:59.400 --> 40:02.440
But we didn't have textbooks then, right?

40:02.440 --> 40:04.800
You can borrow them from your seniors.

40:06.160 --> 40:07.120
I almost forget.

40:07.200 --> 40:08.400
You are not from the main campus, right?

40:08.960 --> 40:11.200
You seem to be the first to come from Keshan.

40:11.400 --> 40:12.640
It is not a surprise that you can't borrow the textbooks.

40:18.800 --> 40:19.600
Stand up.

40:21.080 --> 40:24.160
Good afternoon, teacher.

40:24.640 --> 40:25.520
Sit down please.

40:26.960 --> 40:28.880
We will talk about functions today.

40:29.440 --> 40:31.280
Functions are actually quite simple.

40:31.520 --> 40:33.280
It is not as complex as you think.

40:34.240 --> 40:35.400
Let see the exercise

40:35.640 --> 40:37.920
from the last college entrance exam.

40:39.320 --> 40:40.480
Like this one here,

40:40.640 --> 40:42.840
it is basically a point you must get.

40:45.320 --> 40:47.960
Get the f(x).

40:49.600 --> 40:50.960
How should we solve this question?

40:51.320 --> 40:54.240
Use the method of undetermined coefficients.

40:54.600 --> 40:56.320
How to solve it? Louder.

40:56.760 --> 41:00.160
Use the method of undetermined coefficients.

41:01.080 --> 41:03.400
This is a method you have been taught.

41:03.440 --> 41:06.120
How come some of you still don't know it?

41:07.400 --> 41:08.840
That girl at the back,

41:13.040 --> 41:14.120
stop looking.

41:15.680 --> 41:17.240
Don't look around. It is you.

41:17.720 --> 41:18.560
Stand up.

41:21.120 --> 41:22.520
How should we solve this question?

41:25.400 --> 41:26.800
I don't know.

41:27.360 --> 41:28.200
What?

41:29.760 --> 41:30.840
I don't know.

41:32.800 --> 41:33.800
Zhou Siyue.

41:33.960 --> 41:34.760
You answer it.

41:38.320 --> 41:39.840
Read extracurricular books?

41:40.160 --> 41:41.320
I shall see how you work this out.

41:41.880 --> 41:44.320
The method of undetermined coefficients means

41:44.400 --> 41:47.120
f(x)=ax²+bx+c.

41:47.560 --> 41:49.920
Put this formula into the known equation,

41:50.200 --> 41:53.360
we can get that a=1/2.

41:53.600 --> 41:55.000
b=-2.

41:55.280 --> 41:57.200
And since we know that f(0)=2,

41:57.400 --> 41:59.400
then c=2.

42:00.200 --> 42:01.000
Very good.

42:01.640 --> 42:02.640
Zhou Siyue, please sit down.

42:05.360 --> 42:06.360
You sit down too.

42:11.320 --> 42:12.400
Did you all get it?

42:12.840 --> 42:14.280
Yes, sir.

42:42.920 --> 42:43.800
Interested?

42:48.960 --> 42:49.840
No.

42:50.720 --> 42:51.760
Stop being narcissistic.

42:54.040 --> 42:55.640
I mean the book,

42:56.920 --> 42:58.680
not me.

43:00.440 --> 43:02.720
Is it not cottoning up with you, right?

43:02.920 --> 43:03.800
Miss Temporary Deskmate?

43:05.720 --> 43:06.520
Childish.

43:12.080 --> 43:12.960
You've taken so many notes down.

43:13.040 --> 43:13.920
Can you review them all?

43:14.200 --> 43:15.120
None of your business.

43:21.600 --> 43:22.720
This paragraph here,

43:22.920 --> 43:24.640
the only useful part is this formula.

43:25.200 --> 43:26.760
You just have to memorize this.

43:27.120 --> 43:28.200
About your habit of taking every note down,

43:28.240 --> 43:29.440
if you keep doing it,

43:30.000 --> 43:31.720
you will be sifted out of the key class soon.

43:35.840 --> 43:37.880
You are just above the minimum passing score.

43:38.160 --> 43:39.440
You're ranked 45th and I am 38th.

43:39.480 --> 43:40.640
Who are you to judge me?
